WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:04.759
Hello, one and all, and welcome back to the
Anom-O-Tron 6000.

00:00:04.759 --> 00:00:10.050
Our patented device for projecting any seemingly
improbable scenario for your viewing indulgence.

00:00:10.050 --> 00:00:14.969
And today, we decided to do something slightly
different with it.

00:00:14.969 --> 00:00:19.680
Here at SCP Explained, we usually activate
the Anom-O-Tron to bring you encounters between

00:00:19.680 --> 00:00:25.310
the anomalous denizens of the SCP Universe
and other fictional characters, like Doctor

00:00:25.310 --> 00:00:30.400
Strange fighting the Scarlet King, or Able
crossing paths with Batman.

00:00:30.400 --> 00:00:35.590
But this Anom-O-Ton experiment is one of our
more unusual, to say the least.

00:00:35.590 --> 00:00:39.590
If you’ve been subscribed to us for a while,
some of you might remember our video ‘What

00:00:39.590 --> 00:00:44.219
If SCP-096 Was Put Inside SCP-914?’.

00:00:44.219 --> 00:00:48.719
In it, the Shy Guy was tricked into entering
the Input booth of the anomalous refinement

00:00:48.719 --> 00:00:51.059
machine during a containment breach.

00:00:51.059 --> 00:00:56.020
What emerged was maybe the handsomest man
to ever live, beautiful both on the outside

00:00:56.020 --> 00:00:57.260
and within.

00:00:57.260 --> 00:01:03.050
A lot of our comments pointed out that this
refined version of 096 felt akin to a ‘Giga

00:01:03.050 --> 00:01:10.020
Chad’, and that got us thinking; what if
SCP-096 was to encounter the real Giga Chad?

00:01:10.020 --> 00:01:15.760
Well, the Anom-O-Tron 6000 has a few different
answers for us.

00:01:15.760 --> 00:01:20.260
Scenario One – or as we like to call it,
‘The Obvious Outcome’ – pits the thin,

00:01:20.260 --> 00:01:23.350
humanoid anomaly against the man behind the
meme.

00:01:23.350 --> 00:01:28.400
Ernest Khalimov is a Russian fitness trainer
and model, forever immortalized in the annuls

00:01:28.400 --> 00:01:32.870
of internet history by a series of black and
white photoshopped pictures that garnered

00:01:32.870 --> 00:01:35.490
him the nickname of ‘Giga Chad’.

00:01:35.490 --> 00:01:40.509
Thanks to his practically perfect ninety-degree
jawline and muscular physique, Khalimov seemingly

00:01:40.509 --> 00:01:44.740
unknowingly became the archetype for an ultra-masculine,
handsome man.

00:01:44.740 --> 00:01:49.259
However, the man behind the Giga Chad meme
is still, just a man.

00:01:49.259 --> 00:01:54.869
The infamous photos of him were heavily edited
for an art project known as Sleek’N’Tears,

00:01:54.869 --> 00:01:59.160
and while Ernest does sport some impressive
muscles from all his time at the gym, that

00:01:59.160 --> 00:02:02.689
strength isn’t enough to save him from the
Shy Guy.

00:02:02.689 --> 00:02:05.750
After all, he’s still just a man.

00:02:05.750 --> 00:02:09.560
According to the Anom-O-Tron’s predictions,
the most likely outcome if the two were ever

00:02:09.560 --> 00:02:14.490
to meet would end pretty similarly to the
grim fate of many others who have gazed upon

00:02:14.490 --> 00:02:17.330
the face of SCP-096.

00:02:17.330 --> 00:02:22.660
The moment Ernest looks at the creature, he
would – in all likelihood – activate SCP-096’s

00:02:22.660 --> 00:02:23.720
rage state.

00:02:23.720 --> 00:02:28.420
His physique and above-average level of fitness
might give him a slight advantage, allowing

00:02:28.420 --> 00:02:31.670
him to perhaps outrun the Shy Guy for longer
than most.

00:02:31.670 --> 00:02:38.500
But ultimately, Ernest Khalimov would be able
to run, but not hide, from SCP-096.

00:02:38.500 --> 00:02:43.190
The creature would track him down and home
in on him with anomalous speed, dispatching

00:02:43.190 --> 00:02:46.900
him before returning to its usual, docile
sobbing state.

00:02:46.900 --> 00:02:47.900
The result?

00:02:47.900 --> 00:02:50.019
An SCP-096 victory.

00:02:50.019 --> 00:02:52.000
Now, we know what you’re thinking.

00:02:52.000 --> 00:02:53.000
Is that really it?

00:02:53.000 --> 00:02:56.580
We had the same reaction too, but hold on
for a minute.

00:02:56.580 --> 00:03:01.110
After giving the machine an additional set
of variables, we were able to get a few more

00:03:01.110 --> 00:03:03.800
interesting outcomes out of the Anom-O-Tron.

00:03:03.800 --> 00:03:09.380
Which brings us to the result that we’ve
given the title of ‘Scenario Two: Shy Harder’.

00:03:09.380 --> 00:03:13.701
Of course, Ernest Khalimov might be the face
of an internet meme, and ultimately just a

00:03:13.701 --> 00:03:18.860
very strong Russian man in comparison to the
anomalous traits of SCP-096.

00:03:18.860 --> 00:03:20.050
But the Giga Chad?

00:03:20.050 --> 00:03:26.220
The Giga Chad is more than a man, so much
more than the sum of his parts.

00:03:26.220 --> 00:03:31.780
Existing within the online zeitgeist since
as early as 2017, the Giga Chad is far more

00:03:31.780 --> 00:03:33.670
powerful than a mere mortal.

00:03:33.670 --> 00:03:38.920
He doesn’t just represent idealized standards
of over-exaggerated masculinity like the action

00:03:38.920 --> 00:03:44.500
movie heroes of the 1980s; the Giga Chad embodies
those ideas.

00:03:44.500 --> 00:03:50.209
He is the very notion of a physically perfected
human specimen given form.

00:03:50.209 --> 00:03:54.849
You may not like it, but peak performance
doesn’t even come close to the Giga Chad.

00:03:54.849 --> 00:04:00.379
And neither does SCP-096; even at the top
of its game, the creature quite literally

00:04:00.379 --> 00:04:03.860
pales in comparison to its imposing opponent.

00:04:03.860 --> 00:04:09.760
In Scenario Two: Shy Harder, the Anom-O-Tron
6000 predicted that, if the two were to meet,

00:04:09.760 --> 00:04:13.890
the scales would tip in the complete opposite
direction from the first outcome.

00:04:13.890 --> 00:04:19.769
For that was SCP-096 against the man, but
against the meme himself – well, this fight

00:04:19.769 --> 00:04:21.299
is no contest.

00:04:21.299 --> 00:04:25.540
As a matter of fact, it’s hardly even a
fight – certainly not a fair one – and

00:04:25.540 --> 00:04:28.610
instead is more of an execution.

00:04:28.610 --> 00:04:33.950
From the moment the unstoppable tower of muscle
and perfect angular jawline that is the Giga

00:04:33.950 --> 00:04:40.350
Chad claps eyes on SCP-096, it’s practically
the beginning of the end.

00:04:40.350 --> 00:04:45.550
The Shy Guy doesn’t even lift, bro – but
Giga Chad can bench one million times his

00:04:45.550 --> 00:04:47.800
own bodyweight in his sleep.

00:04:47.800 --> 00:04:52.970
So, when SCP-096 comes racing towards him,
intent on killing him just for looking at

00:04:52.970 --> 00:04:59.500
its screeching, wide-jawed face, the Giga
Chad does what the Giga Chad does best: he

00:04:59.500 --> 00:05:00.500
lifts.

00:05:00.500 --> 00:05:05.830
Grabbing SCP-096 with ease as it comes at
him screeching, Giga Chad casually hoists

00:05:05.830 --> 00:05:07.669
the creature off the ground.

00:05:07.669 --> 00:05:12.360
Although he’s only using the tiniest portion
of his immense and infinite strength, it’s

00:05:12.360 --> 00:05:16.570
more than enough force to send the Shy Guy
soaring upwards, crashing through multiple

00:05:16.570 --> 00:05:21.800
ceilings as it’s sent hurtling up the numerous
floors of the Foundation facility above.

00:05:21.800 --> 00:05:26.030
Of course, being lifted is hardly going to
kill the Shy Guy outright – the creature

00:05:26.030 --> 00:05:28.620
is known to be invulnerable, after all.

00:05:28.620 --> 00:05:32.210
But it’s not like the Giga Chad can go down
easily either.

00:05:32.210 --> 00:05:37.360
Don’t forget, this is no mere mortal, but
an internet meme incarnate.

00:05:37.360 --> 00:05:40.569
And on the internet, nothing ever dies.

00:05:40.569 --> 00:05:45.889
His perpetual existence as part of online
history aside, the Giga Chad is so strong

00:05:45.889 --> 00:05:50.850
that no doubt his abs could withstand the
firepower of any conventional weapon.

00:05:50.850 --> 00:05:56.009
Realizing that, even if it could reach him,
it couldn’t even scratch the Giga Chad,

00:05:56.009 --> 00:05:59.970
SCP-096 would undoubtedly begin a downward
spiral.

00:05:59.970 --> 00:06:04.910
The Shy Guy is a creature so insecure in itself
and its appearance that it kills anyone who

00:06:04.910 --> 00:06:10.350
so much as glances at its face in photos,
so being presented with the living embodiment

00:06:10.350 --> 00:06:16.310
of an idea it could never even hope to attain
– the biceps, the perfect right-angled jawline

00:06:16.310 --> 00:06:18.669
– it’s all too much.

00:06:18.669 --> 00:06:23.940
Sending SCP-096 into a complete meltdown,
the creature would be neutralized once and

00:06:23.940 --> 00:06:29.250
for all by the very existence of the Giga
Chad; resulting in his victory.

00:06:29.250 --> 00:06:34.979
Okay, so we’re one point to SCP-096, and
one to Giga Chad, and most people would maybe

00:06:34.979 --> 00:06:36.750
consider leaving it there.

00:06:36.750 --> 00:06:39.349
But not us, we wanted more than that.

00:06:39.349 --> 00:06:44.849
You see, we quickly realized that the Anom-O-Tron’s
second scenario was based on a lot of earlier

00:06:44.849 --> 00:06:47.069
iterations of the Giga Chad meme.

00:06:47.069 --> 00:06:51.280
Don’t get us wrong, that version of the
ultimate man could still easily destroy the

00:06:51.280 --> 00:06:52.440
Shy Guy.

00:06:52.440 --> 00:06:58.069
But around March of 2021, the infamous photoshopped
images of Ernest Khalimov started to be used

00:06:58.069 --> 00:06:59.889
in slightly different formats.

00:06:59.889 --> 00:07:04.629
That’s the thing about memes, they’re
not only immortal, forever logged in the ancient

00:07:04.629 --> 00:07:08.620
texts of the Way Back Machine and compilation
videos here on YouTube.

00:07:08.620 --> 00:07:14.960
But they’re also adaptable, they can evolve
and change, finding new variations as time

00:07:14.960 --> 00:07:16.180
goes on.

00:07:16.180 --> 00:07:22.160
As such, the ‘Average Fan Vs Average Enjoyer’
meme saw a new use of the Giga Chad.

00:07:22.160 --> 00:07:27.300
Before, the Giga Chad, this notion of the
ideal, ultra-masculine specimen was based

00:07:27.300 --> 00:07:32.889
on – let’s be honest – some pretty outdated
ideas about what it means to be a man.

00:07:32.889 --> 00:07:38.199
After all, it takes more than muscle to be
a man, not every man – or masculine-presenting

00:07:38.199 --> 00:07:43.110
person – has to work out until they’re
built like a brick wall.

00:07:43.110 --> 00:07:48.440
Perhaps the real measure of a man is how sincere,
sensitive, and supportive you can be, as well

00:07:48.440 --> 00:07:53.849
as standing by your interests rather than
caving to old societal standards of masculinity.

00:07:53.849 --> 00:08:00.280
And, after we updated our data, the Anom-O-Tron
6000 was able to give us a new, revised outcome.

00:08:00.280 --> 00:08:06.470
Or, was we liked to call Scenario Three: ‘The
Average SCP-096 Enjoyer’.

00:08:06.470 --> 00:08:12.000
In this projection, the Giga Chad’s true
strength isn’t just his muscular physique

00:08:12.000 --> 00:08:14.180
and his unattainable standards.

00:08:14.180 --> 00:08:19.841
Instead, it’s – in part – the inherent
adaptability of his status as a meme, but

00:08:19.841 --> 00:08:22.449
also his compassion.

00:08:22.449 --> 00:08:28.000
Just like before, he’s more than able to
resist SCP-096’s attacks, and the creature’s

00:08:28.000 --> 00:08:32.950
insecurity comes out, put on full display
when presented with Giga Chad’s sharp jawline.

00:08:32.950 --> 00:08:38.270
But rather than overcome his anomalous adversary
by fighting him, this scenario sees the Giga

00:08:38.270 --> 00:08:40.570
Chad comforting the Shy Guy.

00:08:40.570 --> 00:08:46.649
Through calm empathy and words of affirmation,
he reminds SCP-096 that true acceptance of

00:08:46.649 --> 00:08:52.140
oneself comes from within, and that message
strikes a chord with the creature.

00:08:52.140 --> 00:08:58.339
In a turn of events none of us saw coming,
the Giga Chad offers to help SCP-096 overcome

00:08:58.339 --> 00:09:01.870
his crippling – and deadly – sense of
insecurity.

00:09:01.870 --> 00:09:06.200
The pair start using the on-site gym together
– after hours when there aren’t any innocent

00:09:06.200 --> 00:09:07.950
Foundation personnel around.

00:09:07.950 --> 00:09:14.010
There, Giga Chad not only offers to introduce
SCP-096 to an exercise regime if it’s what

00:09:14.010 --> 00:09:18.500
the creature wants, but also helps the Shy
Guy work on his confidence.

00:09:18.500 --> 00:09:24.210
They form a friendship, with SCP-096 taking
a liking to working out; not because it wants

00:09:24.210 --> 00:09:29.280
to be buff like its new friend the Giga Chad,
but more so because doing so makes it feel

00:09:29.280 --> 00:09:31.341
more comfortable in its own skin.

00:09:31.341 --> 00:09:38.250
SCP-096 gradually starts to like itself more,
even eating healthier thanks to Giga Chad’s

00:09:38.250 --> 00:09:39.250
advice.

00:09:39.250 --> 00:09:44.220
Eventually, the Shy Guy begins looking far
more content and even starts to develop self-confidence,

00:09:44.220 --> 00:09:45.220
thanks to the Giga Chad’s patience, understanding
and support for his homie.

00:09:45.220 --> 00:09:46.220
The result is a tie.

00:09:46.220 --> 00:09:47.220
Pretty wholesome, right?

00:09:47.220 --> 00:09:48.220
After using the Anom-O-Tron almost exclusively
for death matches between SCPs and other fictional

00:09:48.220 --> 00:09:49.220
characters, it’s a nice change of pace to
get one with a happy ending.

00:09:49.220 --> 00:09:50.220
And that got us thinking, it’s not often
that a story involving SCP-096 exists with

00:09:50.220 --> 00:09:52.180
the creature getting to achieve some semblance
of happiness.

00:09:52.180 --> 00:09:57.790
Well, there is one that comes to mind, the
very same Shy Guy story that sent us on this

00:09:57.790 --> 00:10:01.839
particular streak of pitting it against the
Giga Chad in the first place.

00:10:01.839 --> 00:10:04.680
But what if we put them together?

00:10:04.680 --> 00:10:08.600
Would coming across a refined SCP-096 spell
the end for the Giga Chad?

00:10:08.600 --> 00:10:13.800
Or would the muscular, masculine meme undo
the Shy Guy’s previous happy ending?

00:10:13.800 --> 00:10:16.899
Well, according to the Anom-O-Tron 6000, neither.

00:10:16.899 --> 00:10:23.300
When we last left him, after being turned
into a handsome, nine-feet tall man, SCP-096

00:10:23.300 --> 00:10:26.020
had just started going by the name David.

00:10:26.020 --> 00:10:31.200
SCP-987, the Desire Camera, had been used
to photograph the refined Shy Guy.

00:10:31.200 --> 00:10:35.540
It showed him holding hands with the Foundation
scientist responsible for his transformation,

00:10:35.540 --> 00:10:40.740
who had studied the new and improved SCP-096
in great detail.

00:10:40.740 --> 00:10:43.040
She had quite the understanding of him.

00:10:43.040 --> 00:10:48.660
But perhaps the photograph from the Desire
Camera was more of a metaphor, and what SCP-096

00:10:48.660 --> 00:10:53.540
– or David – really desired, wasn’t
specifically the researcher who’d studied

00:10:53.540 --> 00:10:56.510
him, but a partner who understood him.

00:10:56.510 --> 00:10:58.740
Someone to call an equal.

00:10:58.740 --> 00:11:00.620
Enter the Giga Chad.

00:11:00.620 --> 00:11:05.010
According to the calculations made by the
Anom-O-Tron, the embodiment of ultimate masculinity

00:11:05.010 --> 00:11:10.090
– both strong and sensitive – came bursting
into the Foundation facility.

00:11:10.090 --> 00:11:15.470
There, the moment he and David saw each other,
was like the meeting of an unstoppable force

00:11:15.470 --> 00:11:17.670
and an immovable object.

00:11:17.670 --> 00:11:20.860
Neither one rushed to solve their encounter
with violence.

00:11:20.860 --> 00:11:26.540
Both the Giga Chad and SCP-096 appreciated
each other’s aesthetic appeal; both were

00:11:26.540 --> 00:11:31.570
remarkably handsome, and one couldn’t bear
the thought of ridding the world of the other.

00:11:31.570 --> 00:11:32.570
Instead…

00:11:32.570 --> 00:11:34.639
it was love at first sight.

00:11:34.639 --> 00:11:40.130
Both David, formerly known as SCP-096, and
the Giga Chad fell head over heels in love

00:11:40.130 --> 00:11:41.300
with each other.

00:11:41.300 --> 00:11:44.390
And looking at both, it was hard not to see
why.

00:11:44.390 --> 00:11:49.829
They were a pair of fine, perfectly chiseled
fellas, and they instantly hit it off.

00:11:49.829 --> 00:11:55.620
The newly established couple enjoyed each
other’s company, spending time in deep conversations,

00:11:55.620 --> 00:12:00.500
SCP-096 introducing his new partner to his
friends at the Foundation, while Giga Chad

00:12:00.500 --> 00:12:05.060
was comfortable within his own masculinity
to express his feelings towards David without

00:12:05.060 --> 00:12:07.000
fear of judgment.

00:12:07.000 --> 00:12:09.530
No relationship is perfect, of course.

00:12:09.530 --> 00:12:12.740
For a short time, a sliver of David’s old
self re-emerged.

00:12:12.740 --> 00:12:17.360
The Shy Guy in him worried that perhaps his
relationship with the Giga Chad was based

00:12:17.360 --> 00:12:22.620
purely on both of their extreme good looks,
and was nothing more than superficial.

00:12:22.620 --> 00:12:27.970
But being an embodiment of healthy, idealized
masculinity, the Giga Chad was able to sense

00:12:27.970 --> 00:12:29.840
something was wrong with David.

00:12:29.840 --> 00:12:34.990
And, rather than do the insecure thing of
letting it fester, he addressed it directly,

00:12:34.990 --> 00:12:39.470
and they discussed the issue in a healthy,
mature, and constructive way.

00:12:39.470 --> 00:12:44.700
Not just so they could put SCP-096’s worry
to rest, but so that both of them could further

00:12:44.700 --> 00:12:48.500
strengthen their relationship, and grow as
people.

00:12:48.500 --> 00:12:54.220
And, of course, Giga Chad wasn’t just attracted
to SCP-096’s refined good looks.

00:12:54.220 --> 00:12:59.690
Far from being superficial, he recognized
that David was a complete person, beautiful

00:12:59.690 --> 00:13:05.529
both inside and out, and loved him as a whole,
not just because they were both conventionally

00:13:05.529 --> 00:13:07.220
attractive on the surface.

00:13:07.220 --> 00:13:12.750
SCP-096 and the Giga Chad stayed together
for the rest of their lives or, as we decided

00:13:12.750 --> 00:13:17.690
to name this fourth scenario from the Anom-O-Tron:
‘Happily Ever After’.

00:13:17.690 --> 00:13:22.149
Now go and check out “CAN SCP-096 CHASE
ITS VICTIMS ACROSS THE MULTIVERSE?”

00:13:22.149 --> 00:13:27.740
and “SCP-096 TALE A LESSON IN POWER” for
more SCP-096!

